                "retweet_count": 41,
                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "After years of fighting to make the Summer EBT program permanent, I'm proud to say that starting THIS SUMMER\u2014it is. This means that at least a half a million kids in Washington state will be able to get the nutrition they need\u2014even when school is out. https://t.co/1w0WV65AoC",
