                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "Reporting live from Evergreen Primary School, I had the chance to talk a few of our littlest students about Pierce County's Gardening and Nutrition Early Childhood Education program! \ud83e\udedb\ud83e\uded0\ud83e\udd55\ud83e\udd6c\ud83c\udf45\n\nThis is a great program and I'll keep pushing for federal dollars to support it. https://t.co/lYIBCSBOlX",
