                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "WIC is a lifeline for mothers and babies to get the support and nutrition they need. I fought hard to fully fund the program last year\u2014and when I met with WA state WIC providers I made clear that I intend to keep WIC fully funded for the future. https://t.co/ADV3FmeyKm",
