                "text": "Republicans want to throw Medicaid, nutrition assistance, and veterans\u2019 benefits into the wood chipper\u2014they are calling for $1 trillion in cuts just this year alone!\n\nAll so billionaires get MORE tax cuts. No way. I'm speaking out, and I'm voting NO!",
